  "title": "SysEx: Add dissector table for manufacturer ID",
  "description": "This allows users to hook custom Lua dissectors for MIDI SysEx data by registering them in the `sysex.manufacturer` table.\n\nI used this to write a Lua dissector for RME audio interface sysex packets during development of oscmix:\nhttps://github.com/michaelforney/oscmix/blob/main/tools/rme.lua\n\nI made sure the `sysex_digitech` dissector still works by sending a sysex packet with manufacturer `00 00 10`. The handoff to `sysex_digitech` still works correctly.",
  "state": "merged",
